From 9d98759cbc2daa7a9ddbfb8a4e12fb18a62dfa84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: scama
 <a1860575018c4680d5669dd7bc3bd356b478bccb8d42e194df46304a5e25f49a@meshllm.communities.buzz.xyz>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 21:07:25 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: bind stable semantic graph identities

Register request inputs through the common helpers exercised by the generated dense, Granite Hybrid, Nemotron-H, and Mamba proof profiles. Helper-specific inputs outside that corpus remain a later acceptance unit; semantic graph construction fails closed when any external input lacks an explicit registration.

Package-v2 Tensor.id admission is not proven by this patch and remains the next acceptance gate.
